This licence covers this repository's own build glue: the Dockerfiles,
tools/, firmware/ (the fw-probe source and its build files) and the
documentation. It does NOT cover:

- each image folder's sidecar.c and build_lib.sh, which are
  GPL-2.0-or-later (each file says so in its SPDX header), because the
  sidecar loads QEMU and the build script follows the QEMU fork's own;
- QEMU and its fork, built inside the images (GPL-2.0; see each image's
  README.md and the SOURCE.txt inside the image);
- the ROM images and the third-party code linked into the prebuilt firmware
  images (see firmware/README.md).
